NT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">입학자는 납입금 납부에 관한 제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">규정에 의거 소정기일 내에 입학금, 수업료 등을 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">납부하여야 하며, 미 납시는 재입학 허가를 취소함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 178%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 178%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 20.07pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 8.75pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 161.57pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMI